OL,3,AUkraine says Starlink still restricted
OL,4,Aafter Trump says limits lifted
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US president had denied instructing
OL,7,Fthe tech billionaire to restrict
OL,8,Fconnectivity to Starlink's
OL,9,Fmilitary-grade counterpart, Starshield,
OL,10,Fbefore saying on Thursday that Musk had
OL,11,F"put it back".
OL,13,FMusk previously said he was not behind
OL,14,Fthe slowdown, which affect Ukraine's
OL,15,Fability to use attack drones and
OL,16,Fco-ordinate defensive operations.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
